  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C, fan-forced. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the capsicum and unpeeled sweet potato into 2cm chunks. Drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507096/photos/large/148840_1-de25b5f17e9e8649c21cdef24f70704c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season veggies: Put the capsicum and sweet potato on the lined tray. Drizzle with 2 tsp olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507097/photos/large/148840_2-94b223a843bc634e989b3b1ce9bf2b73.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast veggies: Roast the veggies for 15 mins. Scatter over 1½ tsp Greek seasoning and roast for a further 5 mins or until golden and tender. Remove from the oven and cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507098/photos/large/148840_3-2d5ca4791f438ec6f43153a02ad69da0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make dressing: Meanwhile, combine 1½ tsp Greek seasoning, 1 tbs olive oil, 2 tsp red wine vinegar and 1 tsp dijon mustard in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507099/photos/large/148840_4-f18d5a17d0b292b676bd92bf52ab5910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Crumble the vegan feta into the dressing. Add the chickpeas, rocket, olives and roasted veggies and toss to combine. Divide the salad among plates and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507100/photos/large/148840_5-700c2afed1a98762994e59ab6881b1b1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you have some tomatoes on hand, coarsely chop and add to the salad. Yummo!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1507101/photos/large/148840_6-168f97f77c6118cd856b6faa2356afc9.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
